case_studies:
  - eyebrow: "Case study 01"
    heading: "The Ground That Flooded Twice"
    meta: "School ground, Ballabhgarh · 7-a-side football turf · 1,150 sq m · 2025"
    dark: false
    columns:
      - heading: "Challenge"
        text: "Two previous contractors had laid turf on the same ground. Both surfaces lifted within one monsoon. The school had lost two seasons and most of its faith in contractors."
        items:
          - "Standing water after every rain"
          - "Turf seams opening at the low corner"
          - "No drainage design on either previous contract"
      - heading: "Solution"
        text: "We surveyed levels before quoting and found the ground fell towards the building, not away from it. The turf was never the problem."
        items:
          - "Re-graded the sub-grade to a 1:100 cross fall"
          - "New perimeter channel and geotextile-wrapped drain"
          - "200 mm graded sub-base compacted to 95% Proctor"
          - "50 mm monofilament turf over a 12 mm shock pad"
      - heading: "Result"
        text: "Through two monsoons with no standing water and no seam movement. The school now runs paid evening slots on it, which covers the AMC."
        items:
          - "Playable within 60 minutes of heavy rain"
          - "Zero warranty claims to date"
          - "Annual AMC signed at handover"
  - eyebrow: "Case study 02"
    heading: "One Tennis Court, Four Pickleball Courts"
    meta: "Residential club, Gurugram · conversion · 2025"
    dark: true
    columns:
      - heading: "Challenge"
        text: "A single ageing tennis court booked twice a week, while forty residents had started asking for pickleball. The committee did not want to lose tennis entirely."
        items:
          - "Court surface at end of life, hairline cracking"
          - "Split membership between two sports"
          - "Budget for one court, not five"
      - heading: "Solution"
        text: "Full resurface, then dual marking: tennis in white, four pickleball courts in a contrasting colour inside the same enclosure."
        items:
          - "Crack repair and 6-coat acrylic resurface"
          - "Tennis lines white, pickleball in blue"
          - "Portable pickleball net posts, sleeved"
          - "Lighting upgraded to 300 lux"
      - heading: "Result"
        text: "Court utilisation went from two sessions a week to daily. The committee added a second conversion the following year."
        items:
          - "4 pickleball courts within the tennis footprint"
          - "Tennis retained, no membership lost"
          - "Delivered in 11 working days"

